  "reason": "Existing evidence shows that multimodal models with scvi_n200 RNA encoder and imagenet_vit_l image encoder (e.g., config_039) achieve high validation accuracy (0.725). This experiment tests whether switching to scgpt RNA encoder (while keeping image encoder, aggregation, and fusion methods identical) improves performance, isolating the impact of RNA representation. It directly compares a promising RNA encoder (scvi_n200) with a newer one (scgpt) in the same multimodal setup, addressing uncertainty about RNA encoder effectiveness without changing multiple factors."
}

